        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Citadel Siege</strong> is a strategic tower defense game where your mission is simple — <strong>stop the enemy from reaching your citadel</strong>. Deploy a variety of unique warriors along enemy paths to intercept and destroy incoming waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each unit plays a crucial role: some excel in melee combat, others attack from range, while support units poison enemies or strengthen nearby allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware — your enemies are not mindless! Some will rush through your lines with speed, while others split into even more dangerous forms upon defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must <strong>build barriers</strong>, <strong>control the battlefield</strong>, and <strong>plan your troop placement with precision</strong>. Outsmart the enemy, hold the line, and defend the heart of your kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your strategy hold against the darkness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Classic tower defense gameplay with tactical depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙 Unique units with active and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧟 Evolving enemy waves with special mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Walls and structures to control enemy movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ Multiple environments and increasingly tough challenges</p></li></ul>",
